Question 1: Why was my card charged twice this month?
Outcome: Answered
Answer: A duplicate charge usually happens when the payment gateway times out or does not answer
        in time, causing the charge to be retried [1, 2]. In rare cases, both the original charge
        and the retry succeed, resulting in you being charged twice [2].

